  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.743.1 defines requirements for intelligent visual surveillance (IVS). The requirements are based on identifying specific objects, behaviours or attributes in video signals. The IVS system transforms the video signals into structured data, which can be transmitted or archived so that the video surveillance system can act accordingly.This Recommendation defines the scenarios, the reference architecture and the requirements for IVS.</abstract>
